<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/codeLists/edg11> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasName> "Gender Diverse People: Non-Binary"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/codeLists/edg11> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gender Diverse People: Non-Binary"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/codeLists/edg11> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "People whose gender identity does not align with a binary understanding of gender such as man or woman. It is a gender identity which may include man and woman, androgynous, fluid, multiple, no gender, or a different gender outside of the \u201Cwoman\u2014man\u201D spectrum."@en .
